cff-version: 1.2.0
title: news
authors:
  - alias: jennymaeleidig
version: 0.2.0
date-released: "2026-09-13"
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/jennymaeleidig/news"
abstract: >-
  A personal source log that publishes RSS feeds. sources.toml is
  the registry — 23 sources subscribed directly in a reader app,
  1 published here: the Richmond Times-Dispatch. The published site
  is the store: each hourly run merges fresh fetches against the live
  feed, failures re-emit the predecessor byte-stable, and no API keys
  are involved.
